Official license text:
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html

SPDX identifier: `AGPL-3.0-only`

The repository root and desktop application remain under the root project's GPLv3 license unless a component explicitly states otherwise. Third-party components retain their own licenses as recorded in [THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES](../THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES).

